Output assets/demo.gif
Set Width 1200
Set Height 800
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set FontSize 14
Set Padding 10

Type "echo 'peek — htop for codebases'" Enter
Sleep 500ms
Type "peek --help" Enter
Sleep 1000ms
Type "peek . --no-tui" Enter
Sleep 2000ms
Type "peek find \"auth\" ." Enter
Sleep 1500ms
Type "peek --pack --ask \"auth\" | head -20" Enter
Sleep 1500ms
